<body lang="EN-US">
<div class="WordSection1">

<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30pt; padding-bottom: 15pt; border-bottom: 3pt double #0284c7;">
    <h1 style="color: #0f172a; font-size: 26pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border: none;">Academic Portfolio & Super Admin CMS</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0;">Comprehensive Technical Documentation & Beginner Development Guide</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt; color: #64748b;">Author: Vella Manikanta | Project: MyPortfolio System | Date: August 2026</p>
</div>

<h1 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 2pt solid #0284c7; padding-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 24pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;">Comprehensive Technical Documentation & Step-by-Step Development Guide</h1><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Academic Portfolio & Super Admin Content Management System (CMS)</h2><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">🎯 Purpose of This Document</h2><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">This document explains how this complete web project—an <strong>Academic & Professional Portfolio Website</strong> integrated with a <strong>Super Admin Content Management System (CMS)</strong>—was conceptualized, architected, and built from the initial phase to the final production-ready application.</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">It serves a dual purpose:</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Technical Project Documentation:</strong> Complete, authoritative reference for developers, software architects, and maintainers.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Beginner-Friendly Learning Guide:</strong> Formatted so that anyone with little or no prior IT/programming background can understand how full-stack web applications function and learn how to build a similar project from scratch.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">1. 🔍 ANALYZE THE ENTIRE PROJECT</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Source Code Analysis Summary</h3><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">The repository contains a complete, self-contained full-stack web application designed for academic faculty, researchers, and technical professionals.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Frontend Stack:</strong> HTML5, CSS3 (Modern Glassmorphism Design System), Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+), FontAwesome 6 Icons, Google Fonts (Inter, Fira Code, Outfit).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Backend Stack:</strong> Native PHP 8+, Apache Web Server (XAMPP Environment).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Data Persistence Layer:</strong> JSON-based File Database (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> for portfolio items and visitor messages; <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code> for password hashes).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>APIs & Asynchronous Communication:</strong> RESTful HTTP JSON API (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>) communicating via the browser JavaScript <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">fetch()</code> API.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Authentication & Security:</strong> PHP Session Management (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">$_SESSION['admin_logged_in']</code>), BCRYPT Password Hashing (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_hash()</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_verify()</code>), HTML Input Sanitization (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">htmlspecialchars()</code>), and File Upload Extension Validation.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">2. 💡 PROJECT OVERVIEW</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">What the Project Is</h3><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">The project is a <strong>responsive, modern Academic & Professional Portfolio Website</strong> accompanied by a secure <strong>Super Admin Dashboard</strong>. It enables academic faculty and researchers to showcase their bio, research publications, teaching skills, career history, education degrees, certifications, institutional committees, and professional memberships.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">What Problem It Solves</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Eliminates Code Editing for Content Updates:</strong> Traditionally, faculty members had to manually edit HTML files to update publications or certificates. This system provides a web-based Admin Panel where non-technical users can add, edit, or delete portfolio content via simple form modals.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Scattered Academic Profiles:</strong> Academic identity IDs (ORCID, Scopus, Vidwan ID, Google Scholar, Researcher ID) are often scattered across multiple platforms. This site consolidates all verified credentials into a single unified card.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Interactive Document Inspection:</strong> Visitors can filter certifications by academic year and search publications or memberships in real-time, viewing PDF/image certificates directly in pop-up modals without leaving the site.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Target Users & Roles</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Public Visitors (Students, Evaluators, Recruiters, Collaborators):</strong> Browse research papers, inspect certificates, filter memberships, view academic credentials, and send contact messages.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Portfolio Owner / Super Admin:</strong> Log into <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">/admin/login.php</code> to edit bio details, upload new certificate files, manage research publications, add professional memberships, review contact messages, and update admin credentials.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Real-World Analogies for Non-Technical Readers</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Frontend (Website & Admin UI) = Reception Desk & Display Gallery:</strong> The visible interface where visitors view awards and fill out contact slips.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Backend (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>) = Administrative Office Worker:</strong> Processes request forms, verifies authorization, saves document files, and retrieves records from storage.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Database (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">portfolio.json</code>) = Central Filing Cabinet:</strong> The master document binder storing all organized portfolio records in neat categories.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>API (Application Programming Interface) = Messenger Service:</strong> Carries data back and forth between the reception desk (Frontend) and the administrative office (Backend).</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">3. 🛠️ TECHNOLOGY STACK</h2><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 12pt 0; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"><tr style="background-color: #0284c7; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; text-align: left;"><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Layer</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Technology</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Purpose</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Why Used</th></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Frontend Layout</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">HTML5 / PHP</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Structure web pages and render server-side data</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Standard web document markup with native PHP template rendering.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Frontend Styling</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">CSS3 (Glassmorphic)</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">User interface styling, grid layouts, animations</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Custom dark glassmorphism theme using CSS variables, flexbox, CSS grid, and media queries.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Frontend Scripting</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">JavaScript (ES6+)</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Interactivity, DOM manipulation, Modals, Live Search/Filters</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Lightweight, zero-dependency client-side scripting for real-time responsiveness.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Icons & Fonts</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">FontAwesome 6 & Google Fonts</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Visual iconography & typography</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Enhances user experience with professional academic icons and clean monospace fonts (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">Fira Code</code>).</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Backend Engine</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Native PHP 8+</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Process requests, handle session auth, read/write JSON data</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Ubiquitous, lightweight server-side execution with zero framework overhead.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Web Server</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Apache (XAMPP)</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Serve HTTP requests and host PHP script execution</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Standard web server environment compatible with standard hosting platforms.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Data Storage</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">JSON File Database</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Store portfolio data, messages, and admin credentials</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Simple, portable, database-less storage avoiding complex SQL server configuration.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><strong>Authentication</strong></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">PHP Sessions & BCRYPT</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Secure administrative login and access control</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Provides secure session handling and industry-standard password hashing (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_hash</code>).</td></tr></table><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">4. 🏛️ PROJECT ARCHITECTURE</h2>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">User <em style="color: #0369a1;">( <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Public Visitor / Admin User</strong> )</em>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">HTTP GET / POST</strong> </span>  WebServer <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Apache Web Server / XAMPP</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">WebServer  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Executes PHP</strong> </span>  FrontendPHP <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">index.php / admin/login.php / admin/index.php</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">FrontendPHP  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Renders UI + CSS/JS</strong> </span>  Browser <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">User Browser Client</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Browser  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">User Interactions</strong> </span>  JS <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">script.js / Admin JS Scripts</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">JS  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Filter / Search</strong> </span>  DOM <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">DOM Manipulation & Modal Windows</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">JS  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Async fetch API Requests</strong> </span>  API <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">admin/api.php REST API</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Session Check</strong> </span>  Auth <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Session Auth & Security</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Read / Write</strong> </span>  FileDB <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;"> <em style="color: #0369a1;">(data/portfolio.json)</em> </strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Verify Hash</strong> </span>  CredDB <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;"> <em style="color: #0369a1;">(data/admin_creds.json)</em> </strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Upload Files</strong> </span>  AssetStore <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">assets/certificates/</strong> </div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Architecture Explanation</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Client Request:</strong> When a user visits <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>, the Apache Web Server executes PHP scripts to read <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> and generate HTML.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Client-Side Scripting:</strong> JavaScript (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>) initializes interactive features such as publication detail modals, certificate document viewers, and live search/filter engines.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Admin Actions:</strong> When the authenticated admin saves a change in <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>, an asynchronous HTTP POST request (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">fetch</code>) is dispatched to <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>4.</strong> <strong>Backend Processing:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code> validates parameters, checks the admin session, and updates <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> or stores uploaded certificate files in <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/certificates/</code>.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">5. 🚀 DEVELOPMENT PHASES (THE COMPLETE JOURNEY)</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 1 – Problem Understanding</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Understand the need for an academic portfolio that can be updated dynamically without touching HTML code.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Analyzed academic requirements (displaying Scopus/ORCID IDs, Vidwan ID 521179, Springer/AIP publications, NPTEL/ATAL certificates, professional memberships like CSI, IAENG, IRED, ISTE).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Academic faculty require clean, verified, and downloadable records for evaluations and accreditation.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> N/A (Planning phase).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> Domain research.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Clear vision of the portfolio structure and admin workflow.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Identifying what information the website needs to show and who will use it before writing code.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 2 – Requirement Analysis</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Define exact functional and non-functional requirements.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Documented feature specs: public portfolio single-page application (SPA style), dark tech aesthetic, real-time search/filter toolbars, file modal popups, secure admin login, and full CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) management.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Prevents scope creep and ensures proper architecture design.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> Requirement specification notes.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> Technical writing.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Structured list of requirements for frontend and backend modules.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Writing down a detailed shopping list of all features needed for the website.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 3 – Planning & Schema Design</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Design the data schema and folder structure.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Modeled JSON schemas for portfolio sections (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">about</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">experience</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">skills</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">research</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">education</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">certifications</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">roles</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">contact</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">messages</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">memberships</code>).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Having a single JSON file as a database requires a clean, scalable structure.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> JSON schema design.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Standardized JSON format ready for database reads/writes.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Designing the layout of the digital filing cabinet where all website content will be saved.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 4 – Technology Selection</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Choose lightweight, fast, and easily deployable technologies.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Selected native PHP and JSON file database over heavy SQL databases to ensure instant local XAMPP execution and zero server dependencies.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Guarantees portability and fast page loads without database connection errors.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> N/A.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> PHP, JavaScript, CSS3, JSON.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Tech stack selection finalized.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Selecting the right tools (PHP, JavaScript, CSS) that work well together.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 5 – Project Setup & Environment Configuration</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Set up local development directory and XAMPP server environment.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Created project root at <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">c:\xampp\htdocs\myportfolio</code>, configured subfolders (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">scratch/</code>).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Organizes files logically into frontend, admin backend, assets, and data storage.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> Directory hierarchy.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> XAMPP, Windows File System.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Working local web server environment accessible via <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">http://localhost/myportfolio/</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Creating the folder on your computer where the website code lives and turning on the web server.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 6 – Frontend UI/UX Development</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Craft a high-impact, dark glassmorphism academic website interface.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Built <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code> and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>. Implemented Hero section, Academic Identity card, Experience timeline, Skills grid, Research publications grid, Certifications section, Roles/Committees grid, Professional Memberships grid, and Contact section.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Provides visitors with an engaging, easy-to-navigate academic portfolio.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> HTML5, CSS3, Google Fonts, FontAwesome.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Responsive, visually stunning portfolio layout.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Painting and building the visible pages of the website that visitors see.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 7 – Client-Side Interactivity & Modals Development</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Add real-time client-side search, filtering, and modal popups.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Wrote <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code> to handle modal popups (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">openPaperModal</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">openCertModal</code>), real-time publication search, certification academic year filters, membership category filters (National vs International), visitor counter, and smooth scrolling.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Allows users to inspect publication abstracts and certificate files without page reloads.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> JavaScript (ES6+), DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Instant interactive responses to user clicks and search inputs.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Adding JavaScript code so buttons open popup windows and search bars filter cards live.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 8 – Database & Persistence Implementation</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Implement file-based JSON data management.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Created <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> containing master data structures and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code> for credentials.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Serves as the central repository for dynamic content.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> JSON data formatting.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Portable, human-readable data store.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Filling the digital filing cabinet with initial portfolio information.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 9 – Backend API & Controller Integration</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Build the RESTful backend API handling data retrieval, updates, and file uploads.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Implemented <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code> with endpoints for <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">get_data</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">save_section</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">submit_contact</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">upload_file</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">change_password</code>, and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">delete_message</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Connects frontend inputs to server-side JSON file modification.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> PHP file I/O (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">file_get_contents</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">file_put_contents</code>), <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">json_decode</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">json_encode</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Fully functional server API returning JSON responses.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Building the backend engine that receives data from forms and updates the filing cabinet files.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 10 – Authentication & Security System</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Secure the admin panel against unauthorized access.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Developed <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/login.php</code> using PHP sessions and BCRYPT password hashing. Protected <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code> and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code> with authentication verification routines.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Ensures only the portfolio owner can edit data or view visitor contact messages.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/login.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> PHP Sessions, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_hash()</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_verify()</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Secure login wall denying unauthenticated users access.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Putting a strong lock and key on the administrative backdoor.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 11 – Super Admin Dashboard Development</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Create a full-featured admin management panel.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Designed <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code> featuring a 10-tab navigation system:</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  1. About Section Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  2. Experience Logs Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  3. Skills & Subjects Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  4. Research Publications Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  5. Academic Profile Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  6. Certifications & Workshops Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  7. Roles & Committees Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  8. Contact & Messages Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  9. Professional Memberships Manager</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  10. Security & Password Settings</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Gives the admin complete control over every portfolio section.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> PHP, JavaScript, CSS Flexbox/Grid, Fixed Table Ratios.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Desktop-sized dashboard with zero horizontal scrolling and instant CRUD modal forms.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Building an easy control dashboard where the website owner can manage everything with buttons.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 12 – Error Handling & Edge Case Protection</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Prevent crashes, invalid inputs, and security leaks.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Implemented input validation, fallback values, PHP syntax checks, upload file extension filters, and toast notifications.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Guarantees web application stability under unexpected inputs.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> Defensive Programming, Try/Catch, Status Validation.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Clear error feedback without application crashes.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Teaching the website how to handle mistakes safely without breaking.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 13 – Testing & Quality Assurance</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Validate all features, layouts, and API workflows.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Conducted PHP syntax linting (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">php -l</code>), verified real-time search/filters, validated top-insertion (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">unshift</code>) for new items, and tested certificate file uploads.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Guarantees bug-free production readiness.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> All application files.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> PHP CLI, Browser Developer Tools.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Zero syntax errors and smooth user experience across all modules.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Testing every feature repeatedly to make sure everything works perfectly.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 14 – Layout Optimization & Bug Fixing</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Resolve layout overlaps and formatting issues reported during testing.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong></p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  - Enforced <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">table-layout: fixed</code> and specific percentage column widths across all admin tables to eliminate horizontal scrollbars.</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  - Resolved text overlap issues in <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">STATUS</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">PERIOD</code>, and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">CATEGORY</code> columns.</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">  - Updated National vs International filtering logic in <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code> to prevent substring collision ("international" containing "national").</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Delivers a polished UI experience on desktop viewports.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> CSS Layout Math, JS String Token Normalization.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Perfect alignment across desktop screen sizes.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Fixing alignment issues so text never overlaps and tables fit cleanly on screen.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 15 – Documentation & README</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Produce comprehensive user guides and technical documentation.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Created <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">README.md</code> and this masterclass guide covering system setup, folder structure, credentials, and architecture diagrams.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Facilitates seamless setup, usage, and future development.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">README.md</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> Markdown, Mermaid.js.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Professional documentation for users and developers.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Writing a clear manual so anyone can install and understand the project easily.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Phase 16 – Deployment & Maintenance Readiness</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Goal:</strong> Prepare the application for hosting on production Apache web servers.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What Was Done:</strong> Verified relative file paths, asset directory permissions, and configuration options.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Enables simple drag-and-drop deployment to web hosting environments (e.g., cPanel, Linux VPS, XAMPP).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> Entire codebase.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Technologies:</strong> Apache, File System Permissions.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Expected Result:</strong> Production-ready application package.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Beginner Explanation:</strong> Preparing the complete website folder so it can be uploaded live to the Internet.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">6. 📁 FOLDER STRUCTURE</h2><div style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; padding: 10pt; border-radius: 4pt; border: 1pt solid #334155; margin: 10pt 0; white-space: pre-wrap;">myportfolio/
├── admin/
│   ├── api.php             # REST API endpoint (Handles Auth, JSON Read/Write, File Uploads, Messages)
│   ├── index.php           # Super Admin Dashboard (10-Tab CRUD Management Panel)
│   └── login.php           # Admin Login Page (Session Auth &amp; Password Verification)
├── assets/
│   ├── certificates/       # PDF &amp; Image certificate storage directory
│   ├── css/                # Supplemental stylesheet directory
│   ├── js/                 # Supplemental JavaScript directory
│   └── uploads/            # General user uploads directory
├── data/
│   ├── admin_creds.json    # Admin credentials file (Hashed password store)
│   └── portfolio.json      # Master JSON database (Stores bio, papers, certs, roles, memberships, messages)
├── scratch/                # Developer utility scripts directory
├── index.html              # Static HTML baseline version of the portfolio
├── index.php               # Dynamic PHP frontend template (Primary public website entry point)
├── README.md               # User installation, run guide, and credential reference
├── script.js               # Client-side JavaScript (Modals, Live Search, Category/Year Filters, Counters)
└── styles.css              # Main glassmorphic CSS stylesheet (Dark theme design system &amp; animations)
</div><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Folder Breakdown & File Roles</h3><h4 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Root Directory Files</h4><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>:</strong> The primary public entry point. Loads <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">$portfolioData</code> from <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> and dynamically generates HTML for all portfolio sections. Injecting server data directly into JavaScript objects (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">window.publicationsData</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">window.certificatesData</code>) ensures modal popups open instantly without additional network latency.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.html</code>:</strong> A static backup HTML version of the portfolio.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>:</strong> The master frontend JavaScript file. Manages modal popup renders, live text search, dynamic academic year filters for certifications, exact category filters for memberships (National vs International), visitor counter increments, and smooth navbar scrolling.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>:</strong> The master stylesheet. Implements the dark glassmorphic design system using CSS variables, custom scrollbars, animated grid backgrounds, responsive cards, pill badges, and timeline nodes.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">README.md</code>:</strong> Installation and setup guide detailing XAMPP configuration, default credentials, folder structure, and troubleshooting tips.</p><h4 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; page-break-after: avoid;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/</code> Directory</h4><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>:</strong> The Super Admin Management Dashboard. Provides a desktop-optimized, 10-tab navigation system where the portfolio owner can edit bio details, add/edit/delete records across all sections, upload certificate files, view contact messages, and change admin credentials.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/login.php</code>:</strong> The secure administrative login wall. Accepts admin username and password, submitting them via <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">fetch()</code> to <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code> for verification.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>:</strong> The backend controller engine. Acts as a RESTful JSON endpoint handling GET and POST actions (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">get_data</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">save_section</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">submit_contact</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">upload_file</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">change_password</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">delete_message</code>).</p><h4 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; page-break-after: avoid;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/</code> Directory</h4><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code>:</strong> The single source of truth file-based database storing structured arrays for <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">about</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">experience</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">skills</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">research</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">education</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">certifications</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">roles</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">contact</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">messages</code>, and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">memberships</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code>:</strong> Stores the admin username and BCRYPT password hash securely.</p><h4 style="color: #0f172a; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; page-break-after: avoid;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/</code> Directory</h4><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/certificates/</code>:</strong> Dedicated folder where uploaded PDF documents and image files for certifications are saved.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">7. 🖥️ FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE & USER JOURNEY</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Frontend Layout & Components</h3><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">The public frontend (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>) is designed as a single-page scrolling application with fixed top navigation.</p>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Nav <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Header Navbar</strong>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Hero <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Hero Section & Status Banner</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Hero  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  About <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">About & Academic Identity Card</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">About  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Exp <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Professional Experience Timeline</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Exp  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Skills <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Subjects & Research Capabilities Grid</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Skills  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Pubs <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Research Publications Grid + Modal Viewer</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Pubs  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Edu <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Academic Profile & Degrees</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Edu  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Certs <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Certifications & Workshops + Year Filters + Document Viewer</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Certs  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Roles <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Institutional Committees & Roles</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Roles  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Mems <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Professional Memberships + National/International Filters</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Mems  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Contact <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Contact Form & Info Settings</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Contact  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Footer <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Footer & Visitor Counter</strong> </div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Key Frontend Features</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Academic Identity Integration:</strong> Displays Employee ID (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">2307030947</code>), ORCID (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">0009-0002-0744-6315</code>), Scopus ID (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">57217184378</code>), Researcher ID (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">KII-0590-2024</code>), Google Scholar ID (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">JW8H408AAAAJ</code>), and <strong>Vidwan ID (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">521179</code>)</strong> with direct external profile links.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Interactive Publication Viewer:</strong> Clicking "Details" opens a modal rendering full abstract text, publisher badge (Springer, AIP, IJETT), authors, and clickable DOI hyperlinks.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Certification Document Inspector:</strong> Enables filtering certificates by academic year (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">2025–2026</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">2024–2025</code>, etc.) and provides inline PDF/Image previews.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>4.</strong> <strong>Professional Memberships Module:</strong> Features a search input and category filter buttons (<strong>All</strong>, <strong>National</strong>, <strong>International</strong>). Filters cards live while displaying membership IDs (e.g., <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">CSI-2024</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">IAENG-318492</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">IRED-8924</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">LM-ISTE-9842</code>).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>5.</strong> <strong>WhatsApp Web Direct Link:</strong> Clicking the phone number link automatically launches WhatsApp Web (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">https://wa.me/918978970366</code>).</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">8. ⚙️ BACKEND ARCHITECTURE & REST API</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Backend Controller Design (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>)</h3><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">The backend is structured around a central dispatcher pattern using the <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">action</code> parameter.</p>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Client <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Client Request</strong>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">GET / POST</strong> </span>  API <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">admin/api.php</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  ActionSwitch <strong style="color: #b45309; background: #fef3c7; padding: 2pt 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;">‹Action Parameter›</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">get_data</strong> </span>  GetData <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Read data/portfolio.json</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">save_section</strong> </span>  SaveSection <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Verify Session -> Update Section -> Write JSON</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">submit_contact</strong> </span>  SubmitContact <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Validate Form -> Append Message -> Write JSON</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">login</strong> </span>  Login <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Verify User & Password Hash -> Start Session</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">upload_file</strong> </span>  UploadFile <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Verify Session -> Save to assets/certificates/</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">change_password</strong> </span>  ChangePass <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Verify Current Hash -> Hash New -> Save JSON</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ActionSwitch  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">delete_message</strong> </span>  DeleteMsg <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Verify Session -> Filter Message -> Save JSON</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">GetData  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Return JSON Response</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">SaveSection  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">SubmitContact  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Login  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">UploadFile  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">ChangePass  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">DeleteMsg  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Output</div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Complete API Endpoint Table</h3><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 12pt 0; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"><tr style="background-color: #0284c7; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; text-align: left;"><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Endpoint Action</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">HTTP Method</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Access Level</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Purpose</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Input Parameters</th><th style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #0284c7; font-size: 10.5pt;">Output Format</th></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">get_data</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">GET</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Public</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Retrieve entire portfolio data</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">None</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success", "data": {...}}</code></td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">submit_contact</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">POST</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Public</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Submit visitor contact message</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">name</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">email</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">subject</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">message</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success", "message": "..."}</code></td></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">login</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">POST</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Public</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Authenticate admin user</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">username</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success/error", ...}</code></td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">save_section</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">POST</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Admin Session</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Save updated section array</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">section</code> (name), <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data</code> (JSON string)</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success", "message": "..."}</code></td></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">upload_file</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">POST</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Admin Session</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Upload certificate file</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">file</code> (multipart form binary)</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success", "file_path": "..."}</code></td></tr><tr style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">change_password</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">POST</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Admin Session</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Update admin password</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">current_password</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">new_password</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success", "message": "..."}</code></td></tr><tr style="background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1pt solid #e2e8f0;"><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">delete_message</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">POST</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Admin Session</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;">Delete visitor contact message</td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">msg_id</code></td><td style="padding: 6pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155;"><code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "success", "message": "..."}</code></td></tr></table><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">9. 🗄️ DATABASE & DATA STRUCTURES</h2><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">The project utilizes a <strong>JSON File Database Architecture</strong> (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code>).</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Entity-Relationship Diagram (ERD)</h3>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 ENTITY-RELATIONSHIP (ER) DIAGRAM
