            📌 SEQUENCE & WORKFLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">actor Visitor</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">participant Browser as Frontend  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(index.php)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">participant API as Backend  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(admin/api.php)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">participant DB as JSON Storage  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(portfolio.json)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Visitor <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> Browser: Fills Contact Form & Click Send</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Browser <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> API: POST action=submit_contact  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(name, email, message)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> API: Validate non-empty fields & sanitize HTML</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> DB: Reads portfolio.json -> appends new message -> writes file</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">DB <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span> >API: Write Success</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span> >Browser: Return  <strong style="color: #b45309; background: #fef3c7; padding: 2pt 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;">‹"status": "success", "message": "Message sent!"›</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Browser <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span> >Visitor: Displays Toast Notification & Resets Form</div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Workflow 2: Admin Adding a New Professional Membership</h3>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SEQUENCE & WORKFLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">actor Admin</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">participant AdminUI as Admin Panel  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(admin/index.php)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">participant API as Backend  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(admin/api.php)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">participant DB as JSON Storage  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(portfolio.json)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Admin <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> AdminUI: Click "Add Membership" & Submits Form</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">AdminUI <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> AdminUI: Unshift newItem into local portfolioData.memberships</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">AdminUI <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> API: POST action=save_section  <em style="color: #0369a1;">(section="memberships", data=JSON)</em> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> API: Check $_SESSION <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">'admin_logged_in'</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">🞂</span> DB: Overwrites memberships array in portfolio.json</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">DB <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span> >API: File Save Success</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span> >AdminUI: Return  <strong style="color: #b45309; background: #fef3c7; padding: 2pt 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;">‹"status": "success"›</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">AdminUI <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span> >Admin: Show Success Toast & Prepend Card at Top</div>
    </div>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">11. 🔐 AUTHENTICATION AND SECURITY</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Security Policies & Implementation</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Password Hashing:</strong> Passwords are never stored in plain text. Passwords are hashed using PHP's native <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_hash($password, PASSWORD_DEFAULT)</code> which applies BCRYPT encryption with automatic salt generation. Authentication uses <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">password_verify($password, $hash)</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Session Hijacking Prevention:</strong> Administrative routes (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code> and privileged actions in <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/api.php</code>) enforce session validation:</p><div style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; padding: 10pt; border-radius: 4pt; border: 1pt solid #334155; margin: 10pt 0; white-space: pre-wrap;">   if (empty($_SESSION['admin_logged_in'])) {
       echo json_encode(['status' =&gt; 'error', 'message' =&gt; 'Unauthorized access.']);
       exit;
   }
</div><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Mitigation:</strong> All visitor input submitted via forms is sanitized using <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">htmlspecialchars()</code> prior to persistence and rendering.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>4.</strong> <strong>File Upload Security:</strong> Files uploaded through the admin uploader (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">action=upload_file</code>) undergo extension verification (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">.pdf</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">.png</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">.jpg</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">.jpeg</code>) and sanitization of filenames to prevent directory traversal attacks.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">12. ⭐ FEATURE-BY-FEATURE DOCUMENTATION</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Feature 1: Dynamic Academic Identity Card</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What It Does:</strong> Renders verified research identifiers (ORCID, Scopus, Vidwan ID <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">521179</code>, Google Scholar, Researcher ID, Employee ID).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Provides proof of academic standing to evaluators and institutions.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Mermaid Flow:</strong></p>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">AdminPanel <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Admin Tab 1: About</strong>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Save Vidwan ID 521179</strong> </span>  JSON <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;"> <em style="color: #0369a1;">(portfolio.json)</em> </strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">JSON  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Load Data</strong> </span>  IndexPHP <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">index.php</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">IndexPHP  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Render Card</strong> </span>  UserBrowser <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Public Academic Identity Card</strong> </div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Feature 2: Research Publications with Modal Abstract Viewer</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What It Does:</strong> Displays research papers with publisher badges (Springer, AIP, IJETT). Clicking "Details" opens a modal showing the full abstract and DOI link.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Allows researchers to read paper summaries instantly without navigating away.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Mermaid Flow:</strong></p>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">UserClick <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">User Clicks Details</strong>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">openPaperModal index</strong> </span>  JS <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">script.js</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">JS  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Fetch from publicationsData</strong> </span>  Modal <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Populate #paper-modal & Show</strong> </div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Feature 3: Certifications & Workshops with Academic Year Filter & Document Inspector</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What It Does:</strong> Organizes certificates by academic year filters (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">2025–2026</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">2024–2025</code>, etc.) and provides inline PDF/Image previews.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Proves attendance and completion of FDPs, ATAL, and NVIDIA certifications.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/certificates/</code>.</p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Feature 4: Professional Memberships Module (National vs International)</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>What It Does:</strong> Displays professional body memberships (CSI, IAENG, IRED, ISTE, ABCD Index) with real-time search and exact category filter buttons (<strong>All</strong>, <strong>National</strong>, <strong>International</strong>).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Why Needed:</strong> Showcases active participation in national and international engineering societies.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Files Involved:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">index.php</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">script.js</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">styles.css</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code>, <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">admin/index.php</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;">• <strong>Mermaid Flow:</strong></p>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">User <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Visitor</strong>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Click National Filter</strong> </span>  JS <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">initMemFilters in script.js</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">JS  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Token Normalization</strong> </span>  Match <strong style="color: #b45309; background: #fef3c7; padding: 2pt 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;">‹Match Category?›</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Match  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Exact Match 'national'</strong> </span>  Show <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Display CSI & ISTE Cards</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Match  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Mismatch 'international'</strong> </span>  Hide <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">Hide IAENG & IRED Cards</strong> </div>
    </div>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">13. ⚠️ ERROR HANDLING</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">System Diagnostics & Defensive Measures</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Invalid Form Input Handling:</strong> Frontend forms validate required fields before dispatching requests. Backend APIs re-validate parameters and return standardized JSON error messages (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">{"status": "error", "message": "..."}</code>).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Missing Database Handling:</strong> If <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> or <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code> is missing or corrupted, helper functions handle fallback initialization gracefully:</p><div style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; padding: 10pt; border-radius: 4pt; border: 1pt solid #334155; margin: 10pt 0; white-space: pre-wrap;">   function getPortfolioData($path) {
       if (!file_exists($path)) return [];
       return json_decode(file_get_contents($path), true) ?: [];
   }
</div><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>File Upload Failures:</strong> If an uploaded certificate exceeds server execution limits or is an unsupported format, the server responds with a clear error payload, preventing file corruption.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">14. 🧪 TESTING & QUALITY ASSURANCE</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Automated & Manual Verification Procedures</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>PHP Syntax Verification:</strong> All PHP files are validated using the native CLI linter:</p><div style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; padding: 10pt; border-radius: 4pt; border: 1pt solid #334155; margin: 10pt 0; white-space: pre-wrap;">   php -l index.php
   php -l admin/index.php
   php -l admin/api.php
</div><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Filtering Logic Unit Verification:</strong> Tested category string token matching to prevent substring collisions (e.g., ensuring filtering for <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">"National"</code> does not match <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">"International"</code>).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Responsive Viewport Testing:</strong> Tested layout across desktop screen resolutions (1920x1080, 1440x900, 1366x768) ensuring <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">table-layout: fixed</code> prevents horizontal scrollbars in the Admin Panel.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">15. 🐞 DEBUGGING GUIDE FOR BEGINNERS</h2><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">If an issue occurs, follow this step-by-step 9-step debugging process:</p>
    <div style="margin: 14pt 0; padding: 12pt; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5pt solid #0284c7; border-radius: 6pt; box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <div style="font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0369a1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1pt dashed #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt;">
            📌 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & FLOW DIAGRAM
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step1 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">1. Check Frontend UI / Console</strong>   <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step2 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">2. Inspect Network / API Call</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step2  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step3 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">3. Check Server Logs</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step3  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step4 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">4. Verify JSON Data File</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step4  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step5 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">5. Check Environment Config</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step5  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step6 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">6. Reproduce Issue</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step6  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step7 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">7. Identify Root Cause</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step7  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step8 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">8. Apply Fix</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Step8  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Step9 <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">9. Re-test & Verify</strong> </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Check Frontend:</strong> Open Browser DevTools (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">F12</code>) -> Console tab. Look for JavaScript syntax errors or unhandled promise rejections.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Check Network/API:</strong> Go to DevTools -> Network tab. Perform the action and click the HTTP request (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">api.php</code>). Inspect <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">Payload</code> and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">Response</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Check Server Logs:</strong> Inspect Apache error logs (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">C:\xampp\apache\logs\error.log</code>) for PHP fatal errors or warning stack traces.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>4.</strong> <strong>Check Data Files:</strong> Open <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/portfolio.json</code> in a text editor to ensure JSON syntax is valid and uncorrupted.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>5.</strong> <strong>Check Configuration:</strong> Verify file and folder write permissions for <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/</code> and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/certificates/</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>6.</strong> <strong>Reproduce:</strong> Re-run the exact steps that caused the failure to confirm it is repeatable.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>7.</strong> <strong>Find Root Cause:</strong> Trace the exact code line responsible for the error.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>8.</strong> <strong>Fix:</strong> Edit the specific source file.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>9.</strong> <strong>Test Again:</strong> Clear browser cache and re-test to confirm the bug is resolved.</p><hr style="border: none; border-top: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; margin: 16pt 0;" /><h2 style="color: #0369a1; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bae6fd; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid;">16. 🚢 DEPLOYMENT GUIDE</h2><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Local XAMPP Setup (Development Environment)</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> Install <strong>XAMPP</strong> (with PHP 8.0+ and Apache).</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> Copy the project folder to <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">c:\xampp\htdocs\myportfolio</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> Start the <strong>Apache</strong> module from XAMPP Control Panel.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>4.</strong> Access the site via:</p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">   - <strong>Public Website:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">http://localhost/myportfolio/index.php</code></p><p style="font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1e293b; margin: 6pt 0;">   - <strong>Admin Dashboard:</strong> <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">http://localhost/myportfolio/admin/login.php</code></p><h3 style="color: #0284c7; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-after: avoid;">Production Web Hosting Deployment</h3><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>1.</strong> Upload all project files to the remote web server's <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">public_html/</code> directory via FTP/cPanel.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>2.</strong> Ensure directory write permissions (<code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">0755</code> or <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">0777</code>) are set for <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/</code> and <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">assets/certificates/</code>.</p><p style="margin: 3pt 0 3pt 18pt; font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #334155;"><strong>3.</strong> Update <code style="font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0284c7; padding: 1pt 4pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 10pt;">data/admin_creds.json</code> with a strong password hash using the Admin Security Settings tab.</p>
