9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">admin/login.php Login Wall</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">admin/api.php REST Controller</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">AuthEngine <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">PHP Session & BCRYPT Auth</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Uploader <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">File Uploader Engine</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">PortfolioData <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;"> <em style="color: #0369a1;">(data/portfolio.json Master DB)</em> </strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">CredsData <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;"> <em style="color: #0369a1;">(data/admin_creds.json Auth DB)</em> </strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">CertAssets <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">assets/certificates/ File Store</strong> </div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Browser  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">HTTP GET</strong> </span>  Apache</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Mobile  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2pt 6pt; border-radius: 3pt; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: bold;"> <strong style="color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2pt 5pt; border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 3pt;">HTTP GET</strong> </span>  Apache</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Apache  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  PublicSite</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Apache  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  AdminUI</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: 