; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  AuthEngine</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  Uploader</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">AuthEngine  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  CredsData</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">Uploader  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  CertAssets</div><div style="padding: 4pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0; background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 3pt solid #0284c7; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Calibri', monospace; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #1e293b;">API  <span style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: bold;">➔</span>  PortfolioData</div>
